      "id": "claim_3845dc115d6d405fab18b5daae6b74a9",
      "statement": "celld deploy uses esbuild for bundling only when the entry is unbundled source (pre-bundled entries like a Vite build are imported without re-running esbuild), treats Wrangler config keys as a strict allowlist that refuses unmodeled keys, and never shells out to wrangler or speaks a Cloudflare API.",
