      "statement": "Manifests declare required features (wasm-v1, assets-v1, d1-v1, kv-v1, queues-v1, r2-v1, sqlite-vec-v1, workflows-v1, cron-v1) that both load paths validate identically so an old node refuses at deploy/load rather than at request time, and wasm modules serialize as ModuleKind::Wasm whose default export is a compiled WebAssembly.Module per Wrangler's CompiledWasm rule.",
